[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6120.95, "timestamp": "01:42:00", "text": "，这才是最重要的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6122.79, "timestamp": "01:42:02", "text": "他们到底漏掉了什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6124.47, "timestamp": "01:42:04", "text": "对吧？ 他们到底有什么不可告人的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6126.709, "timestamp": "01:42:06", "text": "秘密？对吧？ 所以才"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6128.149, "timestamp": "01:42:08", "text": "强制所有人执行。 但我感觉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6130.47, "timestamp": "01:42:10", "text": "现在气氛轻松多了。 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6133.91, "timestamp": "01:42:13", "text": "认为人们已经得到了"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6136.057, "timestamp": "01:42:16", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ8_8KpS3_9EP-duW6QoUCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ8_8KpS3_9EP-duW6QoUCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ8_8KpS3_9EP-duW6Qo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6137.669, "timestamp": "01:42:17", "text": "很多。 搞什么鬼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6139.51, "timestamp": "01:42:19", "text": "谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6140.79, "timestamp": "01:42:20", "text": "看来这个快用完了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6142.07, "timestamp": "01:42:22", "text": "。 就像没能顺利出来一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6143.03, "timestamp": "01:42:23", "text": "。   我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6143.669, "timestamp": "01:42:23", "text": "天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6152.47, "timestamp": "01:42:32", "text": "他的字迹太酷了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6156.39, "timestamp": "01:42:36", "text": "他把V写得像树一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6167.59, "timestamp": "01:42:47", "text": "好的，那段视频不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6170.95, "timestamp": "01:42:50", "text": "最近我的重新推荐列表中出现了这个。 我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6174.229, "timestamp": "01:42:54", "text": "就想，“啊。” 所以，我的猜测是对的，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6176.709, "timestamp": "01:42